WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.687
Preface.

00:00:01.637 --> 00:00:04.350
The Necessity of Documentation.

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:12.212
When a state turns its sovereign power against its most vulnerable citizens, the bureaucracy's first instinct is obfuscation.

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:15.425
This ledger is the algorithmic response.

00:00:15.425 --> 00:00:26.387
Over 7 million public records — lobbying registries, financial disclosures, voting histories, auditor general reports — cross-referenced with mathematical rigidity.

00:00:26.387 --> 00:00:28.637
The numbers do not lie.
